### Notification API Test
### Sử dụng với REST Client extension trong VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@token = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Get all notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Get all notifications with filter (unread)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?filter=unread
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get all notifications with filter (important)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?filter=important
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get unread count
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Mark notification as read (replace :id with actual notification ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notifications/67881234567890abcdef1234/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Mark all as read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notifications/mark-all-read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Delete notification (replace :id with actual notification ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notifications/67881234567890abcdef1234
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Delete all notifications
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



